  "description": "Planning permission is sought for the erection of a detached ancillary garden building. \nThe proposal consists of two elements connected beneath a continuous pitched roof enclosing a covered open courtyard. \nThe accommodation comprises a gym and a children’s playroom. The covered courtyard provides a sheltered outdoor family space. \nThe building is intended solely for ancillary domestic purposes.\nThe application demonstrates a proposal which preserves the character of the site, respects the setting of the Local Heritage Asset and does not adversely affect neighbouring residential amenity.\nThe full extent of the proposal is documented within the supporting drawing package to this application. \nThese are shown in plan / elevation form with a scale bar to the drawings. \n",
